      "created_at": "2021-04-26T16:03:08.403Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Since I can’t seem to find it anywhere…during a turn do Lieutenants each get their own turn (like Heroes/Villains) or do they all go at the same time (like Minions) or do they go on the same turn as the Minions?</p>",
